ead a book.","What do you do on a sunny day?","I go to the park and play outside.","No, I prefer cooler weather.","The temperature is thirty degrees today.","Is it going to rain tomorrow?","No, but I've heard of them.","What's the forecast for next week?","Do you check the weather before going out?","Yes, I always check the weather.","Yes, wear a heavy coat.","You should wear a light shirt.","It's freezing outside!","Have you ever seen lightning?","Yes, I saw lightning last night.","Can you hear the thunder?","It's raining cats and dogs!","Yes, it's raining very hard.","The leaves turn red and fall.","What color is your raincoat?","Do you like playing in the rain?","Yes, I like jumping in puddles.","Yes, be careful not to fall.","I make snow angels.","Do you like building snowmen?","Yes, it's very fun!","Have you ever had a snowball fight?","Yes, I had one with my friends.","Yes, the roads are very icy.","Yes, I help my dad shovel.","What's your favorite season?","I like spring the best.","It's warm and the flowers bloom.","What happens in autumn?","What's the hottest month?","Do you like the heat?","The air is very dry today.","Yes, I need to use lotion.","Yes, you can't see very far.","Do you need glasses on foggy days?","What is the dew point?","It's when water condenses.","Have you ever seen a double rainbow?","Yes! It's very beautiful.","What causes a rainbow?","Light and water create a rainbow.","Do you wear sunscreen?","I use SPF fifty.","Do you wear sunglasses?","Yes, I wear them when it's bright.","Yes, once on vacation.","How do you protect yourself from the heat?","I drink lots of water.","Do you use a fan?","I like mild and sunny weather."]}
